[h2]Build 0.9.10[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Weapon arms for the power suits, made at the fabrication bench after the power suits research. Right-click a standing suit with a colonist selected to fit an arm to its left or right side, or to take one off. The suit shows its arms, standing or worn.
[*]Bulwark arms: minigun, autocannon, laser, rocket pod, grenade launcher, arc projector, flamer, hammer, chainsaw and tower shield.
[*]Bughunter arms: a fuel-injected flamer (longer range, hotter flames) and a pneumatic power hammer.
[*]A gun arm is the pilot's weapon while they are in the suit; their own weapon is stowed and given back when they climb out. Two arms with the same gun fire together as one twin gun; with two different guns, a button switches between them.
[*]Hammer, chainsaw and power hammer arms add their strikes to the pilot's melee attacks. The tower shield makes the suit much harder to hurt; two tower shields stand side by side as a shield wall.
[/list]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]With Exosuit Framework installed, the lightweight suits' recipes are hidden again (an error since 0.9.9).
[/list]
